- Nothing to do: every user message is automatically matched against history and injected as a `<selfmem_memory>` fenced block;
- Manual search: ask the agent `selfmem_search {"query":"how to read an image"}`;
- Inspect the auto-captured session trace: `selfmem_trace`.

```text
selfmem_search {"query":"read an image","context":{"model_vision":"no"}}
→ sol-offline-script (applicable); sol-switch-model marked [not applicable to current preconditions]
```

**External import**

```text
selfmem_import {"source":"examples/import-demo.json"}
```

**Mark success / failure**

```text
selfmem_hit  {"query":"install plugin offline","solutionId":"s-…"}
selfmem_fail {"query":"…","solutionId":"s-…","rootCause":"…"}
```
